                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='11'>• Movies dominate the platform with 69.62% of total content.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='11'>• TV Shows account for 30.38% of total content.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='11'>• 8,807 total titles are analyzed in the dataset.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='11'>• Content spans 749 countries/locations.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='11'>• Content additions peaked around 2019.</run>
